post_install() {
    cat <<'MSG'

Bluetooth (iPhone messages and notifications) needs one-time system setup.

tether-btclass@.service is installed but NOT enabled. Enabling it changes how
this machine presents itself over Bluetooth, so that is your call to make.

To see exactly what is left, and the commands to run:

    tether --bt-setup

MSG
}

post_upgrade() {
    post_install
}
